    english: Balanced
    spanish: Equilibrado
  quality:
    english: Quality
    spanish: Calidad
  custom:
    english: Custom
    spanish: Personalizado
  displaySaved:
    english: Display settings saved.
    spanish: "Configuraci\xF3n de pantalla guardada."
  displayRestored:
    english: Previous display restored.
    spanish: Pantalla anterior restaurada.
  pendingChanges:
    english: Unsaved changes. Press Apply to save.
    spanish: Cambios pendientes. Pulsa Aplicar para guardarlos.
  applyHint:
    english: Changes are saved when you press Apply.
    spanish: Los cambios se guardan al pulsar Aplicar.
  confirmHint:
    english: Confirm the display change to keep it.
    spanish: Confirma el cambio de pantalla para conservarlo.
  applied:
    english: Settings applied and saved.
    spanish: "Configuraci\xF3n aplicada y guardada."
  resetDone:
    english: Recommended settings restored.
    spanish: Valores recomendados restablecidos.
  saved:
    english: Current settings saved.
    spanish: "Configuraci\xF3n actual guardada."
  confirmationQuestion:
    english: 'Keep these display settings?


      Reverting automatically in {0}
      s.'
    spanish: "\xBFMantener esta configuraci\xF3n de pantalla?\n\nSe revierte autom\xE1ticamente
      en {0} s."
  vSyncHint:
    english: 'VSync respects the FPS limit; some displays may use a lower rate to
      synchronize.

      3D scaling keeps the UI sharp. Menus and pause: up to 30
      FPS.'
    spanish: "VSync respeta el l\xEDmite elegido; algunas pantallas usar\xE1n una
      frecuencia menor para sincronizar.\nLa escala 3D conserva la nitidez de la
      interfaz. Men\xFAs y pausa: m\xE1ximo 30 FPS."
  fpsHint:
    english: "The FPS limit avoids unnecessary frames. Start with 30\u201360 FPS
      on laptops.\n3D scaling keeps the UI sharp. Menus and pause: up to 30 FPS."
    spanish: "El l\xEDmite de FPS evita dibujar fotogramas innecesarios. 30\u201360
      FPS es un buen inicio en port\xE1tiles.\nLa escala 3D conserva la nitidez de
      la interfaz. Men\xFAs y pausa: m\xE1ximo 30 FPS."
